@title 3D view: metal finish on the plate and rails, and the switch back to flat colours (1366x768)
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768
# Layers > Metal finish (also View > 3D > Metal finish). On: a faint brushed grain, broad galvanising patches and streaks along the rails. Off: the flat colours as before. The same view on and off at the whole-cabinet distance (only the broad patches survive; the fine grain is below a pixel there and fades out by design) and close up (grain and rail streaks show). The pointer rests at the same spot for every picture.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text front view
wait 8
key Enter
wait 40
move 1250 420
wait 15
shot overview-on
click_text "Layers"
wait 8
shot layers-menu-ticked
expect "Metal finish"
click_text "Metal finish"
wait 8
key Escape
move 1250 420
wait 30
shot overview-off
click_text "Layers"
wait 8
click_text "Metal finish"
wait 8
key Escape
wait 10
mouse_down 534 408
mouse_up 534 408
wait 10
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text zoom to fit
wait 8
key Enter
wait 40
key Escape
move 1250 420
wait 30
shot close-on
click_text "Layers"
wait 8
click_text "Metal finish"
wait 8
key Escape
move 1250 420
wait 30
shot close-off
check_layout
